Hi,

I do not think that lavaan is the right software for calculating such mediation effects. Have you looked at the Imai’s and Tingle’s work?

https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/mediation/vignettes/mediation.pdf

To get started with nonlinear mediation models, you should start by clearly defining which mediation effect (natural indirect effect or something else?) you are interested in.

Best regards,

Mikko

