The summary function will probably not provide this information. Use lavInspect(fit, "cor.lv <http://cor.lv>") instead:  https://rdrr.io/cran/lavaan/man/lavInspect.html

Von: lav...@googlegroups.com <lav...@googlegroups.com> im Auftrag von Mary G <marygr...@gmail.com>
Gesendet: Donnerstag, Mai 30, 2024 3:30:58 PM
An: lavaan <lav...@googlegroups.com>
Betreff: Factor correlation parameter estimates

Hello all,

Apologies for the basic question!

When using the lavaan sem function and viewing the output using summary(fit), where can I find the factor correlation parameter estimates?

Many thanks,
Mary

